    {
      "id": "claim_aab5544bb44249fb9686d242694c0e0a",
      "statement": "A confidential Keycloak client whose secret is not pinned in the realm JSON receives a freshly generated secret on every realm import, so the consuming Komodo Variable must be copied from the post-import Credentials page; a stale value makes the RFC 8693 token exchange fail with 401 invalid_client, which surfaces as a missing-configuration error and short-circuits every needs_token tool rather than reporting a wrong secret.",
      "evidence": [
