    {
      "id": "claim_fefa7f8f118d403291fc02146b05d9a9",
      "statement": "A redeploy webhook attached to a single stack only redeploys that stack, so one CD run that promotes new digests for all CI-built images leaves the other stacks running stale images with silent drift; the fix adopted in Phase 15 is one ResourceSync webhook that reconciles and redeploys every affected stack in `after` order, replacing the per-stack webhooks.",
      "evidence": [
