      "statement": "stacks.toml's one ResourceSync was later extended with three feature-025 Control-Tower support stacks that hang off the same core chain rather than forming a second deploy path: prod-audit is an independent root (after = []), prod-vault follows prod-auth because it is logically in the auth tier while living in its own block, and prod-observability follows prod-mcm-bff as graph ordering only (no hard dependency); every block carries deploy = true, so one push still reconciles and redeploys all seven stacks.",
