    {
      "id": "claim_19bad285ba074cadaf378366dae49739",
      "statement": "Edits to infrastructure-as-code/komodo/stacks.toml are gated in both directions and each gate encodes a real deploy failure: scripts/check-komodo-sync.mjs, run in the guardrails naming job, fails on any infra-topology literal in komodo/*.toml (a *.ts.net host, a Tailscale CGNAT IP, or a hardcoded URL authority, comments included), forcing host/domain/webhook values to stay [[NAME]] Variables; and scripts/__tests__/komodo-stack-env.guard.test.mjs requires every ${VAR:?…} a prod compose declares to appear in that stack's environment block, because that block is the only declaration of the stack's required inputs and a missing variable is absent at docker compose config time — invisible in CI and only firing on a real Komodo deploy.",
